Description: Software-defined radio for USRP, ADALM-Pluto, and RTL-SDR hardware
 SoDaRadio is a software defined radio implementation of a general
 purpose transmitter/receiver supporting Ettus USRP, ADALM-Pluto, and
 RTL-SDR hardware.
